,"wikitext":"* [[Augerfrost]]\n\n{{col-2}}","text":"• Augerfrost"},{"heading":"Titans","level":3,"wikitext":"* [[Jokoul]]\n\n{{col-end}}\n[[Category:Characters]]\n[[Category:Seekers]]\n[[Category:Organization members]]\n[[Category:Suits]]","text":"• Jokoul"}],"full_text":"Unnamed Suit 010 is a Suit working for the Organization, previously commanded by DeFoe. She is one of the recruits stationed in Paris, France.\n\nHistory\n\nThis Suit was recruited by DeFoe for additional assistance in the attempt to secure the legendary Ring of Arc. Within the Paris Catacombs, this Suit was captured and impersonated by Zhalia Moon. [Divide and Conquer]\n\nAbilities\n\nLike most Suits, she was issued with the standard Organization Titans and spells.\n\nSpells\n\n• Augerfrost\n\nTitans\n\n• Jokoul","raw_wikitext":"{{Infobox character\n| image  = File:Unnamed Suit 010.png\n| group  = [[The Organization]] {{Icon|ORG}}<br>[[Suits]]\n| base   = [[Paris, France]]\n| gender = Female\n| hair   = Pink\n| eyes   = \n| first  = \"[[Divide and Conquer]]\"\n}}\n'''Unnamed Suit 010''' is a [[Suit]] working for [[the Organization]], previously commanded by [[DeFoe]]. She is one of the recruits stationed in [[Paris, France]].\n\n== History ==\nThis Suit was recruited by [[DeFoe]] for additional assistance in the attempt to secure the legendary [[Ring of Arc]]. Within the [[Paris Catacombs]], this Suit was captured and impersonated by [[Zhalia Moon]]. {{Source|Divide and Conquer}}\n\n== Abilities ==\nLike most Suits, she was issued with the standard Organization Titans and spells.\n\n{{col-begin}}\n{{col-2}}\n=== Spells ===\n* [[Augerfrost]]\n\n{{col-2}}\n=== Titans ===\n* [[Jokoul]]\n\n{{col-end}}\n[[Category:Characters]]\n[[Category:Seekers]]\n[[Category:Organization members]]\n[[Category:Suits]]","categories":["Characters","Organization members","Seekers","Suits"],"links":[{"target_id":"huntik:page:1990","status":"resolved","target_title":"The Organization","label":"The Organization","target_url